# The system user of Herkos's "programs" tool (vilna-mcp-apps@.service).
# polkit (50-vilna-apps.rules) lets it install, update and remove Flatpak
# apps from Flathub and Vilna, and nothing else. No home, no login.
u vilna-apps - "Herkos programs tool" /var/cache/vilna-mcp-apps /usr/sbin/nologin
